S COMPETITION AT THE WORLD CHAMPIONS CUP!<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n<p>The 27-hole ISPS Handa All-Abilities Competition at the World Champions Cup was contested over two days \u2013 Thursday, December 7 and Friday, December 8. Mirroring the World Champions Cup format and inspired by the passion and tradition of the Ryder Cup and Presidents Cup, the ISPS Handa All-Abilities Competition featured Team International, Team Europe and Team USA squaring off as the teams battle for international pride and global bragging rights.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The following nine players were selected based on their <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wagr.com\/wr4gd-ranking\">World Ranking for Golfers with Disability<\/a> (WR4GD) standing as of October 20:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>","background_switcher":"default","background_switcher_hover":"default","custom-responsive":"hide"}}]}],"mfn_global_section_id":""},{"uid":"656a50afd","attr":{"scroll-visibility":"show","closeable-x":"left","query_post_orderby":"date","query_post_order":"ASC","query_terms_order":"ASC","query_slider_columns":{"desktop":"1","laptop":"1","tablet":"1","mobile":"1"},"background_switcher_ql":"default","query_display_slider_arrow_prev":"icon-left-open-big","query_display_slider_arrow_next":"icon-right-open-big","css_advanced_align_items":{"selector":".mcb-section-mfnuidelement .section_wrapper","style":"align-items","val":{"desktop":"stretch"}},"css_advanced_justify_content":{"selector":".mcb-section-mfnuidelement .section_wrapper","style":"justify-content","val":{"desktop":"space-between"}},"background_switcher":"default","background_switcher_hover":"default","background_switcher_scroll":"default","background_overlay_switcher":"default","classes":"small_card_container"},"wraps":[{"uid":"e1fdf2891","size":"1\/3","tablet_size":"1\/3","mobile_size":"1\/1","attr":{"query_post_orderby":"date","query_post_order":"ASC","query_terms_order":"ASC","query_slider_columns":{"desktop":"1","laptop":"1","tablet":"1","mobile":"1"},"bac